WEBVTT

00:15.800 --> 00:19.050
By the grace of God, 
destroy our demonic foes!

00:55.230 --> 00:59.680
The war with Rosearia is 
going well, for the moment...

00:59.680 --> 01:02.490
But it seems they're 
forming an alliance

01:02.490 --> 01:05.880
with their neighbors to 
turn the tide of the war.

01:05.880 --> 01:10.010
Humans come together in the face of danger.

01:10.010 --> 01:12.510
I'll leave this task to him.

01:22.280 --> 01:25.060
Are you tired, Master?

01:26.200 --> 01:27.190
I'm fine.

01:27.670 --> 01:28.870
Thank you, Satie.

03:03.450 --> 03:07.950
<i>White Rose Knights Commander Alistair</i>

03:09.630 --> 03:14.020
I, the White Rose Knights Commander, 
Alistair, have arrived.

03:15.170 --> 03:18.190
You know why you've been summoned, right?

03:18.670 --> 03:21.380
To retake Ivalias, perhaps?

03:22.100 --> 03:25.350
We can't let the other nations 
continue to take advantage of us.

03:27.410 --> 03:28.560
Go.

03:28.950 --> 03:29.410
Of course.

03:44.320 --> 03:47.370
Gather round, everyone!

03:47.700 --> 03:50.830
It's a simple game that anyone can play!

03:51.290 --> 03:55.380
Guess where the ball ends up and 
I'll give you double your money!

04:00.190 --> 04:02.720
Now, which cup is it under?

04:03.580 --> 04:04.680
This one, perhaps?

04:05.750 --> 04:07.150
Good guess, Missy!

04:07.150 --> 04:08.480
How much will you bet?

04:09.200 --> 04:11.140
I don't have any money.

04:12.290 --> 04:14.850
You want to get in my way when 
you don't have any money?

04:27.210 --> 04:30.520
If you don't have any money, 
you can bet something else.

04:32.150 --> 04:34.450
Now, the answer is...

04:35.740 --> 04:36.710
What?

04:37.010 --> 04:38.090
Huh?

04:38.090 --> 04:39.960
I don't see the ball anywhere.

04:40.450 --> 04:43.160
What? You were cheating?!

04:43.160 --> 04:45.300
You bastard!

04:45.300 --> 04:46.840
Give back my money!

04:47.360 --> 04:49.050
N-No...

04:49.590 --> 04:50.610
You've got it all wrong!

04:50.610 --> 04:51.160
I'll kill you!

04:51.160 --> 04:52.270
It's not like that!

04:52.270 --> 04:53.700
Call the guards!

04:53.700 --> 04:55.300
Stop it! Let me go!

04:55.810 --> 04:56.490
Hey.

04:58.810 --> 05:02.290
What are you doing? 
A maid shouldn't abandon her master.

05:02.950 --> 05:05.750
Master... I'm sorry.

05:05.750 --> 05:08.820
There are just so many new things 
to see, I couldn't help myself...

05:09.300 --> 05:11.330
Huh? That outfit...

05:12.370 --> 05:14.700
Our goal is to scout the enemy.

05:15.410 --> 05:18.080
I can't wear an outfit that 
will attract attention.

05:18.720 --> 05:19.850
Now, let's go.

05:33.170 --> 05:37.540
Looks like that story about the 
"Alliance of Kings" was true.

05:40.170 --> 05:43.650
But the way those soldiers
 are rushing around...

05:49.190 --> 05:52.080
Alliance of Kings?

05:52.320 --> 05:52.990
Yes.

05:53.400 --> 05:56.880
It's an ancient alliance, where countries 
join forces in times of danger,

05:56.880 --> 05:58.540
regardless of their own interests.

05:59.050 --> 06:00.750
I see.

06:00.750 --> 06:02.630
"When the demons attack,"

06:02.630 --> 06:06.720
"we all need to work together 
to fight them off," right?

06:06.720 --> 06:07.360
Yes.

06:08.620 --> 06:11.720
The alliance has been formed three times.

06:12.680 --> 06:15.160
Each time, the Demon Lord's
 army has been defeated

06:15.160 --> 06:17.420
and pushed all the way 
back to Doberberg Castle.

06:19.000 --> 06:21.230
Will the same thing happen this time?

06:21.660 --> 06:23.900
What are you worried about?

06:23.900 --> 06:25.680
You're human, aren't you?

06:26.280 --> 06:29.950
If the Demon Lord's army 
retreats, you'll be free.

06:30.940 --> 06:34.910
In human society, the child 
of a slave is a slave forever.

06:35.840 --> 06:38.870
If you abandon me...

06:38.870 --> 06:42.940
I'll end up like those kids over there.

06:48.350 --> 06:49.370
I see.

06:50.520 --> 06:52.000
Well, don't worry.

06:54.160 --> 06:59.940
The current Demon Lord is the 
strongest and wisest in history.

07:00.230 --> 07:03.900
<i>Both demons and humans have lots of problems.</i>

07:04.940 --> 07:07.130
<i>How do we change that?</i>

07:09.420 --> 07:11.790
Hey! Stop right there!

07:15.200 --> 07:18.120
You're the one who did that 
trick with my cups, right?

07:18.610 --> 07:20.870
That's because you were cheating!

07:20.870 --> 07:22.380
Shut up!

07:22.380 --> 07:24.470
You're going to take responsibility for that.

07:24.470 --> 07:25.340
You can pay me...

07:26.430 --> 07:28.950
...with money and her.

07:33.340 --> 07:35.600
There's nobody around, 
so I suppose it's fine.

07:39.180 --> 07:41.560
Wh-What is that?

07:42.000 --> 07:43.320
Boss!

07:43.820 --> 07:46.020
My legs!

07:47.580 --> 07:49.040
Ice Spear.

08:01.250 --> 08:02.830
I have a question.

08:03.300 --> 08:05.060
Did you do this?

08:05.060 --> 08:05.920
Stop it!

08:05.920 --> 08:07.290
Get rid of this ice!

08:07.730 --> 08:10.220
Hey! Are you listening to me?

08:14.900 --> 08:16.310
What the hell?

08:19.630 --> 08:20.810
F-Fine.

08:20.810 --> 08:22.400
I'm sorry!

08:22.400 --> 08:23.640
Ask whatever you want!

08:24.190 --> 08:26.280
What is the army in this town doing?

08:26.820 --> 08:29.650
The soldiers seem to be in quite a hurry.

08:29.920 --> 08:31.860
I-I don't know.

08:32.460 --> 08:35.820
All right. Then I have no more need of you.

08:36.220 --> 08:37.890
I remember!

08:38.030 --> 08:40.120
I remember!

08:40.770 --> 08:43.520
I heard this story...

08:43.520 --> 08:48.330
Did you know that they've formed that 
"Alliance of Kings" thing to fight the demons?

08:48.330 --> 08:49.590
Is that all you know?

08:50.000 --> 08:51.220
N-No!

08:51.220 --> 08:52.550
Calm down!

08:52.550 --> 08:56.130
Rosearia's army is eager to land a blow

08:56.130 --> 08:59.760
on the Demon Lord's army 
before the alliance does.

09:02.510 --> 09:03.380
<i>I see.</i>

09:03.930 --> 09:07.440
<i>They want to win glory for their own nation</i>

09:07.440 --> 09:09.570
<i>before the alliance is fully formed.</i>

09:09.930 --> 09:13.210
<i>That will put them at an advantage 
during their strategy councils,</i>

09:13.210 --> 09:15.330
<i>and increase their influence after the war.</i>

09:18.160 --> 09:22.490
<i>Of course, if they fail, it will 
put Rosearia in an awful position.</i>

09:23.560 --> 09:25.500
So? Where are they going to attack?

09:25.500 --> 09:27.760
There's only one place, right?

09:27.760 --> 09:28.960
Ivalias.

09:29.370 --> 09:34.300
Its gate is a mess and it's 
poorly-defended, they say.

09:34.760 --> 09:35.920
I see.

09:37.630 --> 09:41.040
Wait! Get rid of these!

09:41.040 --> 09:42.890
Hey!

09:52.010 --> 09:54.740
Welcome back, Ike-sama!

09:55.690 --> 09:59.000
And where have you been?

09:59.680 --> 10:02.660
I was worried when 
I couldn't find you anywhere!

10:02.660 --> 10:05.860
Oh, I was scouting Rosearia.

10:06.750 --> 10:08.450
I found something quite interesting.

10:08.450 --> 10:10.620
That isn't what I asked.

10:11.630 --> 10:15.590
And who's this strange girl?

10:15.860 --> 10:18.770
Oh, I'll introduce you.

10:19.530 --> 10:23.790
I'm Satie, Master's maid.

10:25.760 --> 10:26.930
Maid?

10:27.380 --> 10:29.280
This ugly girl?

10:30.280 --> 10:32.160
Forget her.

10:33.390 --> 10:37.110
I'll be your maid!

10:37.110 --> 10:41.910
My apologies. My master is quite tired.

10:41.910 --> 10:44.080
It's time for him to rest.

10:45.440 --> 10:47.800
Don't you dare try to seduce him, human.

10:47.800 --> 10:53.040
Oh, I could never! I'm ugly, after all.

10:53.290 --> 10:57.510
I was chosen as his maid, nothing more.

10:58.080 --> 10:59.720
Shut up!

11:03.680 --> 11:05.150
Sheesh...

11:35.040 --> 11:37.400
It's eerily quiet.

11:37.400 --> 11:39.140
I don't see any guards, either.

11:39.900 --> 11:42.970
It was probably all they could 
do to rebuild the gates.

11:47.970 --> 11:50.050
We're ready to fire!

11:54.110 --> 11:54.770
Fire!

12:03.860 --> 12:06.150
Wh-What are these things?

12:06.150 --> 12:07.840
Protect the siege engineers!

12:07.840 --> 12:11.200
Skeletons are no match for us!

12:14.620 --> 12:17.020
Enemy attack! Enemy attack!

12:24.880 --> 12:26.720
Messengers! Retreat!

12:26.970 --> 12:28.930
Retreat! Retreat!

12:28.930 --> 12:31.390
Secure a line of retreat!

12:33.600 --> 12:36.350
Good call by their commander.

12:36.690 --> 12:38.880
The White Rose Knights, was it?

12:39.920 --> 12:40.620
Yup.

12:41.330 --> 12:47.030
We were only able to predict this attack 
thanks to your spying, Ike-sama!

12:47.350 --> 12:48.990
Don't try to flatter me.

12:50.400 --> 12:51.450
So humble.

13:01.350 --> 13:02.450
Ike-sama?

13:03.050 --> 13:04.370
Ike-sama!

13:04.970 --> 13:07.350
Ike-sama!

13:14.720 --> 13:17.900
What? The White Rose Knights retreated?

13:18.190 --> 13:18.840
Yes, sir.

13:19.350 --> 13:22.530
The Demon Lord's army set a cowardly trap.

13:22.530 --> 13:25.070
Don't make excuses for your loss!

13:26.980 --> 13:30.390
Jail their commander, immediately.

13:31.720 --> 13:33.580
Commander Alistair?

13:34.560 --> 13:36.960
She's one of our nation's finest generals!

13:37.810 --> 13:40.250
It will affect the soldiers' morale.

13:40.250 --> 13:41.760
I don't care.

13:42.390 --> 13:45.890
She needs to take responsibility 
for her actions.

13:46.350 --> 13:49.930
Or how can I face His Majesty the King?

14:13.280 --> 14:14.800
What?

14:17.500 --> 14:20.500
Awake already, huh?

14:20.920 --> 14:23.460
Why are you sleeping next to me?

14:23.940 --> 14:26.920
How can you talk to me like 
that when I saved your life?

14:30.880 --> 14:34.350
And you fondled me so hard.

14:41.290 --> 14:43.360
So, what happened?

14:43.930 --> 14:46.340
Oh, you don't remember?

14:47.020 --> 14:50.570
I healed you after you took an arrow.

14:56.580 --> 14:58.540
Is anyone here? Anyone?

14:59.700 --> 15:03.660
Well, I'm sure there's 
not even a scar left now.

15:03.660 --> 15:05.030
Thank you.

15:06.540 --> 15:07.520
It's fine.

15:07.520 --> 15:13.290
More importantly, I'm told not a 
single human died during this battle.

15:13.290 --> 15:16.350
What if the Demon Lord gets suspicious again?

15:16.790 --> 15:21.100
I'm trying to find a way for humans 
and demons to live together.

15:21.600 --> 15:24.060
That will never change.

15:28.030 --> 15:31.320
Just stay put for a while.

15:32.560 --> 15:35.440
Even if you're better now, 
you're still human.

15:43.280 --> 15:45.880
<i>So this is the arrow, huh?</i>

15:47.330 --> 15:49.100
<i>I was shot from behind.</i>

15:49.630 --> 15:53.840
<i>So, someone infiltrated the castle? Or...</i>

16:01.240 --> 16:05.660
Ike-sama, I'm so glad you're safe!

16:05.660 --> 16:07.770
I was worried!

16:08.600 --> 16:10.930
I'm sorry. I'm fine now.

16:11.800 --> 16:16.840
Hey! He may have made you his maid,
 but you're still human.

16:16.840 --> 16:19.160
Keep your distance.

16:19.160 --> 16:23.900
I'm just worried about my master.

16:44.530 --> 16:47.030
What are you doing, ugly girl?!

16:47.030 --> 16:49.480
Hey, cut that out!

16:49.480 --> 16:51.760
Out of the way!

16:51.760 --> 16:53.450
Open the door this instant!

16:54.240 --> 16:56.010
Nice, Mr. Ugly!

16:56.010 --> 16:56.760
Ugly?!

16:58.350 --> 17:01.770
No, you're not that ugly. 
Don't worry about it.

17:01.770 --> 17:03.870
Thank you.

17:04.700 --> 17:08.330
There's something I want 
you to look into for me.

17:08.600 --> 17:10.800
Yes, what do you need?

17:11.070 --> 17:13.340
I want to know where the commander of

17:14.090 --> 17:17.180
the White Rose Knights, 
the ones that attacked us, is now.

17:19.290 --> 17:23.000
Dummy! Dummy! Moron!

17:23.000 --> 17:24.610
Ugly!

17:25.220 --> 17:26.730
Pork roast!

17:26.730 --> 17:29.400
Fatso! Loser!

17:27.250 --> 17:28.390
She's like a child.

17:29.400 --> 17:30.590
Piggy!

17:36.710 --> 17:40.990
It seems Alistair, 
commander of the White Rose Knights,

17:40.990 --> 17:44.660
was imprisoned for her 
failure after she retreated.

17:47.580 --> 17:50.310
So that's a human prison, huh?

17:50.310 --> 17:52.360
Seems scary!

17:54.070 --> 17:58.410
And why did you have to come here yourself?

17:58.410 --> 18:00.580
It's dangerous!

18:00.580 --> 18:03.350
Those humans can be violent!

18:03.670 --> 18:06.040
I want to ask her something in person.

18:07.000 --> 18:10.930
And Lilith, I don't believe 
I asked you to come.

18:11.840 --> 18:14.120
But you'd be lonely by yourself,

18:14.580 --> 18:18.280
and we can have all kinds of fun 
if it's just the two of us.

18:20.280 --> 18:24.960
And you brought that 
maid girl last time, right?

18:24.960 --> 18:26.250
That's no fair.

18:27.190 --> 18:30.140
If you're going to follow me,
 at least keep quiet.

18:31.230 --> 18:32.660
Okay!

18:43.520 --> 18:46.450
It doesn't seem to be that well-guarded.

18:46.450 --> 18:48.390
I think I could get in on my own, easily.

18:48.820 --> 18:50.870
I want to avoid causing a fuss.

18:50.870 --> 18:54.360
But I do want to be as peaceful 
and as fast as possible.

18:58.400 --> 19:01.950
Ike-sama, I dealt with them quietly.

19:02.700 --> 19:03.820
Sheesh.

19:08.430 --> 19:09.770
This place is bigger than I thought.

19:10.350 --> 19:13.380
It will take some time to find the commander.

19:14.000 --> 19:16.210
Don't worry about that!

19:22.400 --> 19:24.100
This again?

19:24.550 --> 19:27.040
He said she's on the top floor.

19:27.040 --> 19:28.730
Now, let's go.

19:29.380 --> 19:31.060
What happened to peaceful?

19:33.020 --> 19:34.390
Intruders!

19:35.840 --> 19:37.980
There! Don't let them escape!

19:38.800 --> 19:40.550
Oh, they found us.

19:40.550 --> 19:41.770
Of course they did.

19:42.710 --> 19:44.500
Leave this to me.

19:44.500 --> 19:46.910
You go on ahead.

19:47.170 --> 19:48.870
I'll say this once more.

19:48.870 --> 19:50.780
No unnecessary bloodshed.

19:50.780 --> 19:52.220
Right, right.

20:01.470 --> 20:02.590
My arm!

20:02.590 --> 20:04.300
Somebody help!

20:05.600 --> 20:07.300
I saw nothing.

20:31.970 --> 20:33.410
This should be the room.

20:56.660 --> 20:58.680
What do you want, demon?

20:58.680 --> 21:01.290
Did you come to laugh 
at the defeated general?

21:02.490 --> 21:04.950
I want to ask you a question.

21:07.530 --> 21:09.440
During the last battle,

21:09.440 --> 21:13.520
did you send an assassin 
into Ivalias to kill me?

21:14.680 --> 21:20.380
<i>Was the assassin sent by Alistair?</i>

21:21.440 --> 21:22.400
<i>Or...</i>

21:30.020 --> 21:33.640
Are you really a demon?

21:34.400 --> 21:36.170
What do you mean?

21:36.170 --> 21:37.120
There!

21:38.220 --> 21:39.720
Alistair-sama's room!

21:39.720 --> 21:41.350
Catch him, now!

21:44.340 --> 21:48.210
Don't tell me you're human.

23:34.010 --> 23:38.680
<i>Traitor</i>
